郎の妻で、意地を張ったり子供っぽいところもあるが明るく気のいい、今作のヒロイン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性的なことに関しては生真面目かつやや潔癖気味で、孝太郎を一途に愛してきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"孝太郎とは同じ職場の先輩後輩だったが、結婚後は退職して、別の会社でパート社員をしている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27225","sourceWorkId":"37568","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"孝太郎の妻で、意地を張ったり子供っぽいところもあるが明るく気のいい、今作のヒロイン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性的なことに関しては生真面目かつやや潔癖気味で、孝太郎を一途に愛してきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"孝太郎とは同じ職場の先輩後輩だったが、結婚後は退職して、別の会社でパート社員をしている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"216765"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f3/f38dcd0c60dcf96d7581cf166155aab90bc6c6e42eab0c5cca2a3ccb7d6053f9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d2/d275794db1246793db50f9ef392fb07e37c6004256c743817676807f7798d12a.webp","width":156,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"大路みゅう","creatorId":"vndb:s22612","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s22612","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s22612","name":"大路 みゅう","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:529986:216765:44176:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c148026","characterName":"三辻 花織子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"216766","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"529986"}],"egsCharacterIds":["27226"],"vndbCharacterId":"c148026"},"originalCharacterName":"三辻 花織子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A beautiful older woman who lives next door to Kotaro and his wife. She is the daughter of a wealthy and famous family."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is calm and gentle, and although currently single, she used to be married and has a married-like sexiness."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She seduces Kotaro as soon as he moves in and enjoys a “casual relationship” with him. She also loves Rina as a younger sister and they get along well."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c148026"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"孝太郎夫婦の隣に住む、年上の美しい女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"裕福な名家の令嬢でおっとりして優しく、現在は独身だが以前は結婚していたため、人妻風の色気がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"引っ越して来た早々に孝太郎を誘惑し「割り切ったお付き合い」を愉しんでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"理奈のことも妹分として可愛がり、仲良くしている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27226","sourceWorkId":"37568","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"孝太郎夫婦の隣に住む、年上の美しい女性。裕福な名家の令嬢でおっとりして優しく、現在は独身だが以前は結婚していたため、人妻風の色気がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"引っ越して来た早々に孝太郎を誘惑し「割り切ったお付き合い」を愉しんでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"理奈のことも妹分として可愛がり、仲良くしている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"216766"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e1/e1b76a0bae0fafa66b4715c5667a153e19b67f01bbaa06980a3eb143391247f7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/48/4805cd15ae4e3e4223326aec81343ffac5449cbb945c1194bd05dba82482db9d.webp","width":156,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"佐倉ゆき","creatorId":"vndb:s839","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s839","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s839","name":"佐倉 ゆき","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:529986:216766:15997:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c149556","characterName":"柳瀬 孝太郎","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c149556"},"originalCharacterName":"柳瀬 孝太郎","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist of this work. He is Rina's husband and a company employee of a small to medium-sized company."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"As it is a small company, he works in a department that is a merger of the general affairs and accounting departments."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is often described as a bit insensitive but serious and kind, but in reality he is easily influenced and has a hedonistic side."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c149556"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/73/736b9c7e6545b5ebe63f7345c53ddefcf1e0e2da1970c6d7a1b1cde6346c6f0a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f8/f85c97f79e221248350648acb50a42dc4d3896e06edabfc5c4291585e79863d6.webp","width":118,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c149557","characterName":"中根 秀一","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c149557"},"originalCharacterName":"中根 秀一","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Rina's boss at work, a caring and gentle man with a wife and children."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His family is happy, and he loves his wife and children, but as he comforts and encourages Rina in her distress, they develop a relationship."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c149557"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/99/99033eabe47aa551e2158ffecd6fcdd0b703256c6e701ac5d8a2880f83638ec5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/18/1855286c0845bc11e1123ec88d9dc92